⚠️ [IMPORTANT] [BLOCKING] Buffer overread: access-list entry.account copy without size check

**影响**：`std::copy_n(entry.account.begin(), sizeof(evmc_address), addr.bytes)` assumes `entry.account` is ≥20 bytes. A malformed tars Transaction with shorter account field causes out-of-bounds read.

**证据**：Same pattern at line 541 (storageKeys, expects 32 bytes), line 549 (blob hashes, expects 32 bytes), line 588 (authorizationList address, expects 20 bytes). Note: line 590 has `if (auth.signer.size() == sizeof(evmc_address))` guard — the author knows the pattern but missed 4 other locations.

**建议**：
```suggestion
        if (entry.account.size() < sizeof(evmc_address))
            throw OpConsensusError("access-list account address too short");
        std::copy_n(entry.account.begin(), sizeof(evmc_address), addr.bytes);
```
Apply same pattern for storageKeys (line 541), blob hashes (line 549), and authorizationList address (line 588).

⚠️ [IMPORTANT] [BLOCKING] Buffer overread: storageKeys copy without size check

**影响**：`std::copy_n(sk.begin(), sizeof(evmc_bytes32), key.bytes)` assumes each storage key is ≥32 bytes. Same overread pattern as the account field above.

**建议**：
```suggestion
            if (sk.size() < sizeof(evmc_bytes32))
                throw OpConsensusError("access-list storage key too short");
            std::copy_n(sk.begin(), sizeof(evmc_bytes32), key.bytes);
```

⚠️ [IMPORTANT] [BLOCKING] Buffer overread: blobVersionedHashes copy without size check

**影响**：`std::copy_n(h.begin(), sizeof(evmc_bytes32), hash.bytes)` assumes each blob hash is ≥32 bytes.

**建议**：
```suggestion
        if (h.size() < sizeof(evmc_bytes32))
            throw OpConsensusError("blob versioned hash too short");
        std::copy_n(h.begin(), sizeof(evmc_bytes32), hash.bytes);
```

⚠️ [IMPORTANT] [BLOCKING] Buffer overread: authorizationList[].address copy without size check

**影响**：`std::copy_n(auth.address.begin(), sizeof(evmc_address), ea.addr.bytes)` assumes address is ≥20 bytes. Note: `auth.signer` at line 590 HAS a size check (`if (auth.signer.size() == sizeof(evmc_address))`), but `auth.address` does not.

**建议**：
```suggestion
        if (auth.address.size() < sizeof(evmc_address))
            throw OpConsensusError("authorization entry address too short");
        std::copy_n(auth.address.begin(), sizeof(evmc_address), ea.addr.bytes);
```
